<title>USA: Phar-Mor names new chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>Phar-Mor names new chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>YOUNGSTOWN, Ohio 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Phar-Mor Inc on Tuesday said it promoted Sankar Krishnan to senior vice president and chief financial officer following the resignation of chief financial officer Daniel O'Leary.</p>
<p>Phar-Mor said O'Leary resigned May 13, effective June 12.</p>
